{"title": "Dual Wielder: Bonus Armour Class", "pageid": 22724, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dual_Wielder:_Bonus_Armour_Class", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\">Dual Wielder</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp/300px-Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp, /w/images/b/bb/Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp/300px-Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Dual_Wielder_Bonus_Armour_Class.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Dual Wielder: Bonus Armour Class</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dual Wielder (Feat)\">Dual Wielder</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a>. If you have a melee weapon equipped in both hands, gain +1 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> while wielding a melee weapon in each hand. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dual Wielder (Feat)\">Dual Wielder (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Allandra_Grey\" title=\"Allandra Grey\">Allandra Grey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arcagh\" title=\"Arcagh\">Arcagh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skoona\" title=\"Skoona\">Skoona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Minthara\" title=\"Zombie Minthara\">Zombie Minthara</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">+1 to <a href=\"/wiki/AC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AC\">AC</a> while dual-wielding.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200824\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 702/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4470/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2750/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 379/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 696969/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.423      1 -total\n 97.57%   33.586      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 54.05%   18.606      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 47.59%   16.383      1 Template:PageSeo\n 28.61%    9.850      2 Template:ArmourClass\n 27.14%    9.343      1 Template:WeaponProperty\n 26.36%    9.073      1 Template:Icon_link\n 25.47%    8.767      1 Template:Icon_text\n 21.77%    7.495      2 Template:Trim\n 18.78%    6.465      1 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22724-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200824 and revision id 390048. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}